{"hw":"δουλεύω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">δουλεύω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δουλ-εύω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">δοῦλος</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be a slave,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.56</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.138</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">777d</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">παρά τινι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.129</span> </span>: c. acc. cogn., <span class=\"gk\">δουλείαν δ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mem.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.12.2</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">183a</span> </span>, al. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">serve, be subject,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τό τ' ἄρχειν καὶ τὸ δ. δίχα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">927</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">δ. ζεύγλαις</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">463</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῖς ἄρχουσι καὶ τοῖς νόμοις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">698b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡδονῇ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">238e</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">δ. γαστρί, ὕπνῳ, λαγνείᾳ,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mem.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.6.8</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κεναῖς δόξαις</span> Polystr.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.29</span> </span> W.; <span class=\"gk\">τῇ γῇ δ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make oneself a slave</b> to one's land, i. e. give up rights that one may keep it, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.81</span> </span>; so <span class=\"gk\">δ. τῇ κτήσει αὐτοῦ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">494d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δουλεύομεν δόξαισιν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Philem.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">93.8</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. τῷ καιρῷ</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">accommodate oneself</b> to the occasion, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.441</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pall.</span> </span>); <span class=\"gk\">θυμῷ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdn.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.17.6</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">render a service,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τινά</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PLond.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.1727.11</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(vi A. D.)</span>.</div></div>"}